WORKSPACE

Workspace you work in, and its chats. Changes show in sidebar at once.
- settings
- settings/set
- settings/models
- settings/icons
- settings/themes
- chats
- chat/title
- chat/rename
- chat/archive
- chat/unarchive
- chat/read

User approves settings/set, chat/archive, chat/read first. Theme is per workspace, not per user: each workspace wears its own. Ids come from chats: never guess one. Title a new chat once you know its topic: few words, no full stop.
Details: memory/recall "workspace/choices", "workspace/chats", or by trigger.
